    {
      "source": "Filter the AggregatePath returning the first item matching the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Predicate.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Predicate</code></a>.",
