      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> of <a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a> to <a href=\"../../sql/Column.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Column</code></a> using the given <a href=\"../../sql/Table.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Table</code></a> as column source.",
      "translation": "创建一个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Map</code></a>，将<a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping 中的接口\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a>映射到<a href=\"../../sql/Column.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql 中的类\"><code>Column</code></a>，并使用给定的<a href=\"../../sql/Table.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql 中的类\"><code>Table</code></a>作为列源。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> of <a href=\"../../sql/Column.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Column</code></a> instances by applying the provided mapping function to each\n<a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a> and <a href=\"../AggregatePath.ColumnInfo.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath.ColumnInfo</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>List</code></a>，其中包含由提供的映射函数应用于每个<a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping 中的接口\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a>和<a href=\"../AggregatePath.ColumnInfo.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping 中的类\"><code>AggregatePath.ColumnInfo</code></a>后生成的<a href=\"../../sql/Column.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql 中的类\"><code>Column</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Performs a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html#reduce(U,java.util.function.BiFunction,java.util.function.BinaryOperator)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Stream.reduce(Object, BiFunction, BinaryOperator)</code></a> on <a href=\"../AggregatePath.ColumnInfo.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath.ColumnInfo</code></a> and\n<a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a> to reduce the results into a single <code>T</code> return value.",
      "translation": "对 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html#reduce(U,java.util.function.BiFunction,java.util.function.BinaryOperator)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Stream.reduce(Object, BiFunction, BinaryOperator)</code></a> 在 <a href=\"../AggregatePath.ColumnInfo.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath.ColumnInfo</code></a> 和\n<a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a> 上执行，将结果缩减为单个 <code>T</code> 返回值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The required path resulting from removing the first element of the <a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a> or throwing\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalStateException</code></a> for any <a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a> having less than two elements.",
      "translation": "由移除<a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping 中的接口\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a>的第一个元素所得到的必需路径，或者对于任何少于两个元素的<a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping 中的接口\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a>抛出<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>IllegalStateException</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Provides an <a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a> for the provided <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyPath</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为提供的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyPath</code></a> 提供一个 <a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping 中的接口\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> of <a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a> associated with this column infos.",
