      "translation": "获取所提供<a href=\"../AggregatePath.ColumnInfo.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath.ColumnInfo</code></a>的<a href=\"../AggregatePath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>AggregatePath</code></a>",
